#. ~ Description of gun "heavy rail rifle"
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid "This overpowered and overengineered variant of rail rifle was designed to deliver electromagnetically-driven obliteration right through whatever obstacles that lies in front of it, be it buildings, vehicles or hordes of walking dead.  However, the hefty bulk and weight of this weapon compared to most contemporary rifles makes it somewhat cumbersome to wield; not to mention that it consumes UPS charges at a tremendous rate, making it impractical for use in prolonged engagements."
msgstr ""

